<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in">&#9679;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Launched a physician-partnership model in Taiwan on August 11 beginning with
the collaboration with the </FONT>Taiwan Chronic Disease Healthcare Association <FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">and
