LSC-derived exosome technologies, including exosome purification process development, characterization, specification validation, and
nonclinical evaluation in animal studies.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-indent: -0.25in">&nbsp;</P>

